{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "add2b94c-2724-84a2-93c1-7cc9fe78ca09",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T12:20:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ana Moniz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:16:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:16:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, yes. I need a new recycling bin. Mine, well, it got cracked down the side and the lid's gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:16:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a replacement recycling bin. Let me make sure I have that right, the bin is cracked and the lid is missing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:17:05-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the lid [inaudible] blew off somewhere, and then the bin got run over, I think, by the truck or something. Um, so how do I request one? Is there a form, or do I just tell you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:17:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can just tell me, I can put in the request right now. I'm sorry, you broke up a little there. Did you say the bin got run over?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:17:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Well, I don't know by what. It was in the street on pickup day and it was flattened on one side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:17:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. So cracked and damaged, lid missing. What's the address where it should be delivered?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:17:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 77 Eustis Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:17:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "77 Eustis Avenue, Historic Hill. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:17:56-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. Sorry, I'm kind of in a hurry, my shift at the hotel, I do housekeeping, starts in like forty minutes, so I'm walking and the signal's bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:18:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, we'll keep it quick. Is it the regular size recycling bin, the big one with the wheels?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:18:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, yeah, the big one with wheels. Blue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:18:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Blue, wheeled, got it. And what's the name for the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:18:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ana Moniz. A-N-A, M-O-N-I-Z."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:18:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ana Moniz, M-O-N-I-Z. Thank you. Do you want a callback number in case the delivery needs to be arranged?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:18:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, yeah. It's 401-555-0165."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:18:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] Sorry, I lost you after 401. Could you say that again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:18:45-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0165."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:18:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0165. I have that. So that's a replacement blue recycling bin for 77 Eustis Avenue, for Ana Moniz."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:18:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And, um, do I need to do anything with the old one? Put it out, or..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:19:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd leave the broken one by the curb or next to where the new one will go. They'll usually pick up the old one when they drop off the new one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:19:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And how long does it usually take? Do I need to be home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:19:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You don't need to be home. They just drop it at the property. It's usually within a week or two, depending on how busy things are around the holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:19:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine. Well, can I still put recycling out in the meantime? In, like, a box or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:19:39-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[crosstalk] Yes, go ahead. A sturdy box or a bag that you can see through is fine until the new bin arrives. Just keep it loose and not tied up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:19:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, loose, not tied. Got it. Great, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ana. Have a good shift, and happy New Year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:20:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye."
    }
  ],
